exercises.explanationAr:
return = يعيد (verb)
مثال: I would like to return this item. — أرغب في إعادة هذا المنتج.
مثال آخر: I want to return these shoes. — أريد إعادة هذا الحذاء.

for = لمدة (preposition)
مثال: I have had this pain for two days. — لدي هذا الألم منذ يومين.
مثال آخر: I slept for eight hours. — نمت لمدة ثماني ساعات.

return (verb)
e.g., Please return the keys if you find them.
بالعربية: يعيد

let down (phrasal verb)
e.g., We felt let down by the poor quality.
بالعربية: يخيّب الأمل، يخذل

return policy (noun)
e.g., Always read the return policy before buying clothes online.
بالعربية: سياسة الإرجاع

public services (noun)
e.g., Good public services make daily life easier for residents.
بالعربية: خدمات عامة

from my perspective (phrase)
e.g., From my perspective, the cheaper option offers better value.
بالعربية: من وجهة نظري

if only (phrase)
e.g., If only I had saved more money last year.
بالعربية: ليت

public transport network (noun)
e.g., A reliable public transport network can reduce dependence on cars.
بالعربية: شبكة نقل عام

echo chamber (noun)
e.g., Social media can become an echo chamber.
بالعربية: غرفة صدى (بيئة لا تسمع إلا رأيك)

while (conjunction)
e.g., While I agree in principle, I have some doubts.
بالعربية: في حين

return (noun)
e.g., The fund gave a return of six percent.
بالعربية: عائد

public interest (noun)
e.g., The story was published in the public interest.
بالعربية: المصلحة العامة

public record (noun)
e.g., The journalist checked the claim against the public record.
بالعربية: سجل عام

return on investment (noun)
e.g., The project offers a high return on investment.
بالعربية: العائد على الاستثمار
